    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GOST of Time is like if Hotline Miami and Rick &amp; Morty had a pixel baby that time-traveled and ended up becoming its own grandparent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to a distant and absurd future where even time is subject to government regulations. In this glorious era of progress, an elderly citizen requires vital medication. He acquires a government-approved Time-Clone\u2122 device for pill delivery. The process is, as always, efficient and precise - to get the pills, he must clone himself and send the clone into the machine, where it solves puzzles, retrieves the pills, and travels through time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076100/extras/b970841b31d1578893c7d52f04dfdc1b.poster.avif?t=1728997475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076100/extras/b970841b31d1578893c7d52f04dfdc1b.webm?t=1728997475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076100/extras/b970841b31d1578893c7d52f04dfdc1b.mp4?t=1728997475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076100/extras/16984b30a15b1b36a812c45ce8cbccc0.poster.avif?t=1728997475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076100/extras/16984b30a15b1b36a812c45ce8cbccc0.webm?t=1728997475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076100/extras/16984b30a15b1b36a812c45ce8cbccc0.mp4?t=1728997475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You play as the clone, created to serve a greater purpose. Your job is to face challenges, bypass obstacles, and solve puzzles to retrieve the pills for the old man.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076100/extras/88871effc65db56367aa590ebc71e404.poster.avif?t=1728997475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076100/extras/88871effc65db56367aa590ebc71e404.webm?t=1728997475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076100/extras/88871effc65db56367aa590ebc71e404.mp4?t=1728997475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Every time you go back in time, you'll encounter your past self, repeating all your actions exactly.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boss Fights:</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076100/extras/15cb1ef621faa9a9a31e8b707842cf07.poster.avif?t=1728997475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076100/extras/15cb1ef621faa9a9a31e8b707842cf07.webm?t=1728997475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076100/extras/15cb1ef621faa9a9a31e8b707842cf07.mp4?t=1728997475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>By working with your past selves, you solve puzzles to get the pill. Remember: you're your best ally and worst enemy! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><br>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Time-traveling mechanics: play with your past selves. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Collect ancient artifacts from the Old Era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hemoglobin, pixel violence, and dark humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Free DLC included!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Complete the game in under two hours, and a refund is guaranteed!</i></p>",
