"bb_paragraph\"> Collect ancient artifacts from the Old Era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hemoglobin, pixel violence, and dark humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Free DLC included!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Complete the game in under two hours, and a refund is guaranteed!</i></p>",
